#: background.cpp:50
msgid "E&nable background"
msgstr "Aktiveer agtergrond"

#: background.cpp:52
msgid ""
"If this is checked, KDM will use the settings below for the background. If "
"it is disabled, you have to look after the background yourself. This is done "
"by running some program (possibly xsetroot) in the script specified in the "
"Setup= option in kdmrc (usually Xsetup)."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-appear.cpp:72
msgid "&Greeting:"
msgstr "Groete:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:77
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is the string KDM will display in the login window. You may want to put "
"here some nice greeting or information about the operating system."
"<p> KDM will replace the string '%n' with the actual host name of the "
"computer running the X server. Especially in networks this is a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die string Kdm sal vertoon in die aanteken venster. Jy dalk mag "
"wil hê na plaas hier sommige oulike groete van informasie aangaande die "
"operating stelsel."
"<p> Kdm sal vervang die string '%n' met die ware bediener naam van die "
"rekenaar wat loop die X bediener. in besonder in netwerke Hierdie is 'n "
"goeie idee."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:91
msgid "Logo area:"
msgstr "Embleem area:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:96 kdm-conv.cpp:76 kdm-users.cpp:110
msgid "&None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:97
msgid "Show cloc&k"
msgstr "Vertoon horlosie"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:98
msgid "Sho&w logo"
msgstr "Vertoon embleem"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:110
msgid ""
"You can choose to display a custom logo (see below), a clock or no logo at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies na vertoon 'n pasmaak embleem (sien onder), 'n horlosie of nee "
"embleem na alle."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:116
msgid "&Logo:"
msgstr "Embleem:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:128
msgid ""
"Click here to choose an image that KDM will display. You can also drag and "
"drop an image onto this button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hier na kies 'n beeld wat Kdm sal vertoon. Jy kan asook trek en laat "
"val 'n beeld op hierdie knoppie (e.g. van Konqueror)."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:141
msgid "Position:"
msgstr "Posisie:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:146
msgid "Cente&red"
msgstr "Gesentreer"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:147
msgid "Spec&ify"
msgstr "Spesifiseer"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:157
msgid ""
"You can choose whether the login dialog should be centered or placed at "
"specified coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies hetsy die aanteken dialoog moet wees gesentreer of rangorde na "
"gespesifiseer koördinate."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:166
msgid "&X:"
msgstr "X:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:173
msgid "&Y:"
msgstr "Y:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:180
msgid "Here you specify the coordinates of the login dialog's <em>center</em>."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy spesifiseer die koördinate van die aanteken dialoog se "
"<em>sentrum</em>."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:196
msgid "GUI s&tyle:"
msgstr "Gui styl:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:200
msgid "You can choose a basic GUI style here that will be used by KDM only."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies 'n basiese Gui styl hier wat sal wees gebruik word deur Kdm "
"slegs."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:207
msgid "&Color scheme:"
msgstr "Kleur skema:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:211
msgid "You can choose a basic Color Scheme here that will be used by KDM only."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies 'n basiese Kleur Skema hier wat sal wees gebruik word deur Kdm "
"slegs."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:216
msgid "Echo &mode:"
msgstr "Ego modus:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:219
msgid "No Echo"
msgstr "Nee Ego"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:220
msgid "One Star"
msgstr "Een Ster"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:221
msgid "Three Stars"
msgstr "Drie Sterre"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:225
msgid "You can choose whether and how KDM shows your password when you type it."
msgstr "Jy kan kies hetsy en hoe Kdm vertoon jou wagwoord wanneer Jy tipe dit."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:231
msgid "Locale"
msgstr "Lokalisering"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:238
msgid "Languag&e:"
msgstr "Taal:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:245
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the language used by KDM. This setting doesn't affect a "
"user's personal settings that will take effect after login."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-appear.cpp:289
msgid "without name"
msgstr "sonder om te naam"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:406
msgid ""
"There was an error loading the image:\n"
"%1\n"
"It will not be saved."
msgstr ""
"Daar was 'n fout laaiïng van die beeld:\n"
"%1\n"
"Dit sal nie wees gestoor."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:450 kdm-appear.cpp:500
#, c-format
msgid "Welcome to %s at %n"
msgstr "Welkom na %s na %n"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:514
msgid ""
"<h1>KDM - Appearance</h1>"
" Here you can configure the basic appearance of the KDM login manager, i.e. "
"a greeting string, an icon etc."
"<p> For further refinement of KDM's appearance, see the \"Font\" and "
"\"Background\"  tabs."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-font.cpp:46
msgid "Select Fonts"
msgstr "Kies Skriftipes"

#: kdm-font.cpp:49
msgid "Greeting"
msgstr "Groete"

#: kdm-font.cpp:50
msgid "Fail"
msgstr "Faal"

#: kdm-font.cpp:51
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Standaard"

#: kdm-font.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Here you can select the font you want to change. KDM knows three fonts: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Greeting:</em> used to display KDM's greeting string (see "
"\"Appearance\" tab)</li>"
"<li><em>Fail:</em> used to display a message when a person fails to "
"login</li><li><em>Standard:</em> used for the rest of the text</li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-font.cpp:60
msgid "C&hange Font..."
msgstr "Verander Skrif tipe..."

#: kdm-font.cpp:64
msgid "Click here to change the selected font."
msgstr "Kliek hier na verander die gekose skrif tipe."

#: kdm-font.cpp:68
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Voorbeeld"

#: kdm-font.cpp:69
msgid "Shows a preview of the selected font."
msgstr "Vertoon 'n voorskou van die gekose skrif tipe."

#: kdm-font.cpp:76
msgid "Use anti-aliasing for fonts"
msgstr "Gebruik anti-aliasing vir skriftipes"

#: kdm-font.cpp:77
msgid ""
"If you check this box and your X-Server has the Xft extension, fonts will be "
"antialiased (smoothed) in the login dialog."
msgstr ""
"As jy bevestig hierdie boks en jou X-bediener het die Xft uitbreiding, "
"skriftipes sal wees geantialiaseerde (glad gemaakte) in die aanteken dialoog."

#: kdm-font.cpp:178
msgid "Greeting font"
msgstr "Groete skrif tipe"

#: kdm-font.cpp:182
msgid "Fail font"
msgstr "Faal skrif tipe"

#: kdm-font.cpp:186
msgid "Standard font"
msgstr "Standaard skrif tipe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:50
msgid "Allow Shutdown"
msgstr "Toelaat Afskakel"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:53
msgid "Co&nsole:"
msgstr "Konsole:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:54 kdm-sess.cpp:60
msgid "Everybody"
msgstr "Almal"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:55 kdm-sess.cpp:61
msgid "Only root"
msgstr "Slegs root"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:56 kdm-sess.cpp:62
msgid "Nobody"
msgstr "Niemand"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:59
msgid "Re&mote:"
msgstr "Afgeleë:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:64
msgid ""
"Here you can select who is allowed to shutdown the computer using KDM. You "
"can specify different values for local (console) and remote displays. "
"Possible values are:"
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Everybody:</em> everybody can shutdown the computer using KDM</li> "
"<li><em>Only root:</em> KDM will only allow shutdown after the user has "
"entered the root password</li> "
"<li><em>Nobody:</em> nobody can shutdown the computer using KDM</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies wie is toegelaat na afskakel die rekenaar te gebruik Kdm. "
"jy kan spesifiseer ander waardes vir plaaslike (konsole) en afgeleë "
"vertoon. Moontlik waardes word:"
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Almal:</em> Almal kan afskakel die rekenaar te gebruik Kdm</li> "
"<li><em>Slegs root:</em>"
" Kdm sal Slegs toelaat afskakel na die gebruiker het ingevoerde die root "
"wagwoord</li> "
"<li><em>Niemand:</em> Niemand kan afskakel die rekenaar te gebruik "
"Kdm</li></ul>"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:72
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "Opdragte"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:75
msgid "Ha&lt:"
msgstr "Halt:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:78
msgid "Command to initiate the system halt. Typical value: /sbin/halt"
msgstr "Opdrag na inisieer die stelsel halt. Tipies waarde: /sbin/halt"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:83
msgid "&Reboot:"
msgstr "Herboot:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:86
msgid "Command to initiate the system reboot. Typical value: /sbin/reboot"
msgstr "Opdrag na inisieer die stelsel herboot. Tipies waarde: /sbin/herboot"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:91
msgid "LILO"
msgstr "Lilo"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:93
msgid "Show boot opt&ions"
msgstr "Vertoon boot opsies"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:98
msgid "Enable Lilo boot options in the \"Shutdown...\" dialog."
msgstr "Aktiveer Lilo boot opsies in die \"Afskakel...\" dialoog."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:102
msgid "LILO command:"
msgstr "Lilo opdrag:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:105
msgid "Command to run Lilo. Typical value: /sbin/lilo"
msgstr "Opdrag na hardloop lilo. Tipies waarde: /sbin/lilo"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:110
msgid "LILO map file:"
msgstr "Lilo kaart lêer:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:113
msgid "Position of Lilo's map file. Typical value: /boot/map"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-sess.cpp:118
msgid "Session Types"
msgstr "Sessie Tipes"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:121
msgid "New t&ype:"
msgstr "Nuwe tipe:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:128
msgid ""
"To create a new session type, enter its name here and click on <em>Add "
"new</em>"
msgstr ""
"Na skep 'n nuwe sessie tipe, invoer sy naam hier en kliek op <em>Voeg by "
"nuwe</em>"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:132
msgid "Add Ne&w"
msgstr "Voeg by Nuwe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Click here to add the new session type entered in the <em>New type</em> "
"field to the list of available sessions."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hier na voeg by die nuwe sessie tipe ingevoerde in die <em>nuwe "
"tipe</em> veld na die lys van beskikbaar sessies."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:139
msgid "Available &types:"
msgstr "Beskikbaar tipes:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:142
msgid ""
"This box lists the available session types that will be presented to the "
"user. Names other than \"default\" and \"failsafe\" are usually treated as "
"program names, but it depends on your Xsession script what the session type "
"means."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boks lyste die beskikbaar sessie tipes wat sal wees aangebied na die "
"gebruiker. Name ander as \"verstek\" en \"vaal-veilig\" word gewoonlik "
"behandel as program Name, maar dit hang af op jou Xsessie skrip wat die "
"sessie tipe beteken."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:148
msgid "R&emove"
msgstr "Verwyder"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:152
msgid "Click here to remove the currently selected session type"
msgstr "Kliek hier na verwyder die huidiglik gekose sessie tipe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:164
msgid ""
"With these two arrow buttons, you can change the order in which the "
"available session types are presented to the user"
msgstr ""
"Met hierdie twee pyl knoppies, jy kan verander die volgorde in wat die "
"beskikbaar sessie tipes word aangebied na die gebruiker"

#: kdm-users.cpp:73 kdm-users.cpp:79
#, c-format
msgid "Couldn't create directory %1"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:82
msgid "<default>"
msgstr "<default>"

#: kdm-users.cpp:86
msgid "System U&IDs"
msgstr "Stelsel Uids"

#: kdm-users.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Users with a UID (numerical user identification) outside this range will not "
"be listed by KDM and this setup dialog. Note that users with the UID 0 "
"(typically root) are not affected by this and must be explicitly hidden in "
"\"Not hidden\" mode."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikers met 'n Uid (numeries gebruiker identifikasie) buitekant hierdie "
"omvang sal nie wees gelys deur Kdm en hierdie opstelling dialoog. Nota wat "
"Gebruikers met die Uid 0 (tipies root) word nie geaffekteer deur hierdie en "
"moet wees eksplisiet weg gesteekte in \"nie weg gesteekte\" modus."

#: kdm-users.cpp:92
msgid "Below:"
msgstr "Onder:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:99
msgid "Above:"
msgstr "Boonste:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:107
msgid "Show Users"
msgstr "Vertoon Gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:111
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will not show any users. If one of the "
"alternative radio buttons is selected, KDM will show a list of users, so "
"users can click on their name or image rather than typing in their login."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, Kdm sal nie vertoon enige gebruikers. As een van "
"die alternatiewe radio knoppies is gekose, Kdm sal vertoon 'n lys van "
"gebruikers, sodat gebruikers kan kliek op hulle naam of beeld eerder as te "
"tik in hulle aanteken."

#: kdm-users.cpp:114
msgid ""
"_: selected users\n"
"Selected onl&y"
msgstr "Gekose slegs"

#: kdm-users.cpp:115
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will only show the users checked in the "
"\"Select users\" list."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, Kdm sal slegs vertoon die gebruikers nagegaan in "
"die \"Kies gebruikers\" lys."

#: kdm-users.cpp:117
msgid ""
"_: not hidden users\n"
"Not hidden"
msgstr "Nie weg gesteekte"

#: kdm-users.cpp:118
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will show all non-system users, except those "
"checked in the \"Select users\" list."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, Kdm sal vertoon alle non-system gebruikers, "
"behalwe daardie nagegaan in die \"Kies gebruikers\" lys."

#: kdm-users.cpp:120
msgid "Sor&t users"
msgstr "Sorteer gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:122
msgid ""
"If this is checked, KDM will alphabetically sort the user list. Otherwise "
"users are listed in the order they appear in the password file."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is nagegaan, Kdm sal alfabeties sorteer die gebruiker lys. "
"Andersins gebruikers word gelys in die volgorde hulle verskyn in die "
"wagwoord lêer."

#: kdm-users.cpp:126
msgid "S&elect users:"
msgstr "Kies gebruikers:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:128
msgid "Selected Users"
msgstr "Gekose Gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:130
msgid "KDM will show all checked users."
msgstr "Kdm sal vertoon alle nagegaan gebruikers."

#: kdm-users.cpp:135
msgid "Hidden Users"
msgstr "Weg gesteekte Gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:137
msgid "KDM will show all non-checked non-system users."
msgstr "Kdm sal vertoon alle non-checked non-system gebruikers."

#: kdm-users.cpp:142
msgid "User Image Source"
msgstr "Gebruiker Beeld Bron"

#: kdm-users.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Here you can specify where KDM will obtain the images that represent users. "
"\"Admin\" represents the global directory; these are the pictures you can "
"set below. \"User\" means that KDM should read the user's $HOME/.face.icon "
"file. The two selections in the middle define the order of preference if "
"both sources are available."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan spesifiseer waar Kdm sal verkry die beelde wat voorstelling "
"gebruikers. \"Administrateur\" verteenwoordig die globale gids; hierdie word "
"die prentjies jy kan stel onder. \"Gebruiker\" beteken wat Kdm moet lees die "
"Gebruiker's $Huis/.gesig.ikoon lêer. die twee kiesings in die middelste "
"definieer die volgorde van voorkeur as beide bronkodes word beskikbaar."

#: kdm-users.cpp:149
msgid "Admin"
msgstr "Administrateur"

#: kdm-users.cpp:150
msgid "Admin, user"
msgstr "Administrateur, gebruiker"

#: kdm-users.cpp:151
msgid "User, admin"
msgstr "Gebruiker, administrateur"

#: kdm-users.cpp:152
msgid "User"
msgstr "Gebruiker"

#: kdm-users.cpp:154
msgid "User Images"
msgstr "Gebruiker Beelde"

#: kdm-users.cpp:157
msgid "The user the image below belongs to."
msgstr "Die gebruiker Die beeld onder behoort na."

#: kdm-users.cpp:160
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Gebruiker:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:167
msgid "Click or drop an image here"
msgstr "Kliek of laat val 'n beeld hier"

#: kdm-users.cpp:168
msgid ""
"Here you can see the image assigned to the user selected in the combo box "
"above. Click on the image button to select from a list of images or drag and "
"drop your own image on to the button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan sien die beeld toegeskryf na die gebruiker gekose in die "
"gekombineerde boks boonste. Kliek op die beeld knoppie na kies van 'n lys "
"van beelde of trek en laat val jou eie beeld op na die knoppie (e.g. van "
"Konqueror)."

#: kdm-users.cpp:170
msgid "Unset"
msgstr "Herstel"

#: kdm-users.cpp:171
msgid "Click this button to make KDM use the default image for the selected user."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hierdie knoppie na maak Kdm gebruik die verstek beeld vir die gekose "
"gebruiker."

#: kdm-users.cpp:263
msgid "Save image as default image?"
msgstr "Stoor beeld as verstek beeld?"

