#: kdm-conv.cpp:48
msgid "Automatic Login"
msgstr "Automaties Aanteken"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:51
msgid "Enable au&to-login"
msgstr "Aktiveer auto-login"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Turn on the auto-login feature. This applies only to KDM's graphical login. "
"Think twice before enabling this!"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:60
msgid "Use&r:"
msgstr "Gebruiker:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:62
msgid "Select the user to be logged in automatically."
msgstr "Kies die gebruiker na wees gelog in automaties."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:71
msgid "Preselect User"
msgstr "Vooraf kies Gebruiker"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:77
msgid "Prev&ious"
msgstr "Vorige"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Preselect the user that logged in previously. Use this if this computer is "
"usually used several consecutive times by one user."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:80
msgid "Specif&y"
msgstr "Spesifiseer"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:81
msgid ""
"Preselect the user specified in the combo box below. Use this if this "
"computer is predominantly used by a certain user."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:85
msgid "Us&er:"
msgstr "Gebruiker:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Select the user to be preselected for login. This box is editable, so you "
"can specify an arbitrary non-existent user to mislead possible attackers."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:96
msgid "Focus pass&word"
msgstr "Fokus wagwoord"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:97
msgid ""
"When this option is on, KDM will place the cursor in the password field "
"instead of the user field after preselecting a user. Use this to save one "
"key press per login, if the preselection usually does not need to be changed."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:103
msgid "Password-less Login"
msgstr "Password-less Aanteken"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:105
msgid "Enable password-&less logins"
msgstr "Aktiveer password-less inteken"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:106
msgid ""
"When this option is checked, the checked users from the list below will be "
"allowed to log in without entering their password. This applies only to "
"KDM's graphical login. Think twice before enabling this!"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:114
msgid "No password re&quired for:"
msgstr "Nee wagwoord benodig vir:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:120
msgid "Check all users you want to allow a password-less login for."
msgstr "Bevestig alle gebruikers jy wil hê na toelaat 'n password-less aanteken vir."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:124
msgid "Automatically log in again after &X server crash"
msgstr "Automaties log in weer na X bediener omval"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:125
msgid ""
"When this option is on, a user will be logged in again automatically, when "
"his session is interrupted by an X server crash. Note, that this can open a "
"security hole: if you use another screen locker than KDE's integrated one, "
"this will make circumventing a password-secured screen lock possible."
msgstr ""

